Z||000000||Raydar||12-28-2001||10:15 PM||||Saw this last night. <BR>Just awesome. <BR>Since I've never read any of the books, I thought that I'd be completely lost. Not the case at all. <BR>Some of the best special effects and some of the most beautiful scenery I've ever seen. <BR>I've heard it was filmed in New Zealand, but it kind of reminds me of the Pacific Northwest. <BR>A wonderful fantasy film. <P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||14
