Z||000005||mbramble||12-29-2001||11:24 AM||||Went on opening night with two of my sons and their friends.  I read the books over 20 years ago.  As noted above, the movie brought the characters to life just as I imagined them as I was reading.  I loved it and will probably go again once the hype and lines die down a bit.  <P>I also just re-read The Hobbit and am about to start re-reading The Lord of the Rings trilogy.  Can't wait for the next installment next year.....||||reg||1
